# Noggle the Mind "loses all colors and all other creature types" - not all other card types (the rulings of Eaten by Piranhas differ): Bot2's Ornithopter, a colorless
# 0/2 Artifact Creature - Thopter with flying, stays an artifact creature but is a Noggle and no longer a Thopter, with base power and toughness 1/1 (a 0/2 is
# turned into a 1/1, so both numbers change) and without flying.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Noggle the Mind
Island x17

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Island x19

[Actions]
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
